diff --git a/gcc/config/or1k/or1k.opt b/gcc/config/or1k/or1k.opt
index 146e0f9f0c0..5a5c4c5a0bd 100644
--- a/gcc/config/or1k/or1k.opt
+++ b/gcc/config/or1k/or1k.opt
@@ -114,3 +114,15 @@ Target RejectNegative Mask(SHFTIMM)
 Enable generation of shift with immediate (l.srai, l.srli, l.slli) instructions.
 By default extra instructions are generated to store the immediate to a
 register first.
+
+mlittle-endian
+Target RejectNegative Mask(LITTLE_ENDIAN)
+Generate little-endian code and data.
+
+mbig-endian
+Target RejectNegative InverseMask(LITTLE_ENDIAN)
+Generate big-endian code and data (the default).
+
+mappotech
+Target Mask(APPOTECH)
+Generate little-endian JT5295 code with inert branch slots.
